#: launcher/ui/pages/instance/LegacyUpgradePage.h:45
#, kde-format
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Uppgradera"

#: launcher/ui/pages/instance/LegacyUpgradePage.ui:29
#, kde-format
msgid "<html><body><h1>Upgrade is required</h1><p>MeshMC now supports old Minecraft versions and all the required features in the new (OneSix) instance format. As a consequence, the old (Legacy) format has been entirely disabled and old instances need to be upgraded.</p><p>The upgrade will create a new instance with the same contents as the current one, in the new format. The original instance will remain untouched, in case anything goes wrong in the process.</p><p>Please report any issues on our <a href=\"https://github.com/Project-Tick/MeshMC/issues\">GitHub page</a>.</p><p>There is also a <a href=\"https://discord.gg/PMxPTqwEwj\">discord channel for testing here</a>.</p></body></html>"
msgstr "<html><body><h1>Uppgradering krävs</h1><p>MeshMC stöder nu gamla Minecraft-versioner och alla nödvändiga funktioner i det nya (OneSix) instansformat. Som en följd av detta har det gamla formatet (Legacy) helt inaktiverats och gamla instanser måste uppgraderas.</p><p>Uppgraderingen skapar en ny instans med samma innehåll som den nuvarande, i det nya formatet. Den ursprungliga instansen kommer att förbli orörd, om något går fel i processen.</p><p>Rapportera eventuella problem på vår <a href=\"https://github.com/Project-Tick/MeshMC/issues\">GitHub sida</a>.</p><p>Det finns också en <a href=\"https://discord.gg/PMxPTqwEwj\">discord kanal för testning här</a>.</p></body></html>"

